{"id":"the-doomed-plane","name":"The doomed plane","type":"plane","aliases":["a plane whose name is lost to history"],"description":"A plane whose name is lost to history, more than 6,000 years ago, where Nahiri and Sorin defend refugees until it is unraveled by the Eldrazi.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2014-10-29","last_seen":"2014-10-29","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Lithomancer","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-10-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-lithomancer","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-lithomancer","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Lithomancer\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Oct 2014."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"the-lithomancer-e0","era":null,"summary":"Nahiri raises a stone rampart around a refugee camp, though she knows it will not hold against the monstrous creatures overrunning the plane.","participants":["nahiri","the-doomed-plane"],"location":"the-doomed-plane","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-lithomancer","order":469,"story_date":"2014-10-29","storyline":"The Eldrazi Awaken","source":"wizards","paragraph":6,"quote":"Nahiri, called the Lithomancer, surveyed her work and frowned.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-lithomancer#:~:text=Nahiri%2C%20called%20the%20Lithomancer%2C,her%20work%20and%20frowned.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Lithomancer","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-10-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-lithomancer","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-lithomancer#:~:text=Nahiri%2C%20called%20the%20Lithomancer%2C,her%20work%20and%20frowned.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Lithomancer\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the