ived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Lithomancer\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-lithomancer-e3","era":null,"summary":"Nahiri melts stone with an old spell and draws out a sword for Lian, telling her the world is hers to fight for.","participants":["nahiri","lian"],"location":"the-doomed-plane","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-lithomancer","order":469,"story_date":"2014-10-29","storyline":"The Eldrazi Awaken","source":"wizards","paragraph":39,"quote":"She pulled, and an elegant blade slid free of the molten rock.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-lithomancer#:~:text=She%20pulled%2C%20and%20an,of%20the%20molten%20rock.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Lithomancer","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-10-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-lithomancer","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-lithomancer#:~:text=She%20pulled%2C%20and%20an,of%20the%20molten%20rock.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Lithomancer\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-lithomancer-e4","era":null,"summary":"An enormous Eldrazi rises beyond the valley and the brood surges toward the camp.","participants":["ulamog","eldrazi"],"location":"the-doomed-plane","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-lithomancer","order":469,"story_date":"2014-10-29","storyline":"The Eldrazi Awaken","source":"wizards","paragraph":51,"quote":"Then a figure, impossibly large, rose up behind the hills on the far side of the valley.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-lithomancer#:~:text=Then%20a%20figure%2C%20impossibly,side%20of%20the%20valley.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Lithomancer","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2014-10-29","url":"htt